&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Job Title: &lt;/strong&gt;Product Manager (Data)&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location:&lt;/strong&gt; London, Bristol or Paris (Hybrid - 3 days in office)&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Team:&lt;/strong&gt; Data Products&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Reporting To:&lt;/strong&gt; Director of Product&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;This role is based in London, Bristol or Paris and requires existing right to work in the UK or France.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;At this time, we are not able to offer visa sponsorship for this role. We are committed to building a diverse, global team and our sponsorship policy is evaluated on a role-by-role basis. We encourage you to keep an eye on our careers site to stay informed about future opportunities where we are able to offer visa sponsorship&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Kaluza is the Energy Intelligence Platform, turning energy complexity into seamless coordination. We help energy companies overcome today&#39;s challenges while accelerating the shift to a clean, electrified future. Leveraging Data, AI, and real-time decision-making we turn energy complexity into growth opportunities for our partners.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;By combining predictive algorithms with human-centred design, Kaluza makes clean energy dependable and affordable.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;With teams across Europe, North America, Asia and Australia, and a joint venture with Mitsubishi Corporation in Japan, we power leading companies including OVO, AGL and ENGIE, as well as innovators like Volvo and Volkswagen.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What will I be doing?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;As the Product Manager for Data Product Implementation, your primary responsibility is to successfully lead the data products rollout for a key Kaluza client. You will work closely with engineers and experts in the Kaluza Data Product team, other Kaluza domain Implementation leads, and relevant client subject-matter experts to ensure that our data model and products are localised to meet our client&#39;s needs.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities include:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Client Engagement:&lt;/strong&gt; Articulate Kaluza data products and data models to our key clients.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Requirements &amp;amp; Roadmap:&lt;/strong&gt; Document and translate client requirements for data products and align them with the global product roadmap priorities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Development Support:&lt;/strong&gt; Support development by refining and prioritising backlog items and work with software engineers to deliver solutions that drive value for clients.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Product Adoption:&lt;/strong&gt; Drive product adoption through the creation of technical documentation, release communications, and delivering training sessions for client stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Domain Integration:&lt;/strong&gt; Gain a broad understanding of various Kaluza Product areas—Billing &amp;amp; Payments, Customer Care, Energy Commerce and Energy Optimisation—and how data products can unlock value in each.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data Model Contribution:&lt;/strong&gt; Be a key contributor to Kaluza&#39;s global data model with the potential to own its extension and maintenance for all clients.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Metrics &amp;amp; Culture:&lt;/strong&gt; Work with the team to build and measure the right metrics for product success and nurture a culture of learning from data.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Communication:&lt;/strong&gt; Radiate information, improve transparency and communicate effectively to internal and external audiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About You&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ideally you&#39;ll have/be:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical Experience:&lt;/strong&gt; 3+ years experience as an agile Product Manager working on data platforms/products.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Rollout Experience:&lt;/strong&gt; Experience supporting large-scale enterprise product rollouts, especially on &quot;edge&quot; / localised deployments of a global product.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Stakeholder Management:&lt;/strong&gt; You excel at managing stakeholders, with the ability to value and juggle competing priorities and influence decisions at all levels of the organisation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Communication Skills:&lt;/strong&gt; You excel at written and visual communication to both technical and commercial audiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Problem Solver:&lt;/strong&gt; You are a patient and tenacious problem solver who is willing to roll up their sleeves to learn and understand a domain despite limited knowledge or experience in it.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Collaborative Nature:&lt;/strong&gt; You are a team player who embraces collaboration and knowledge sharing within your team and across different teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What will set you apart&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Language Skills:&lt;/strong&gt; A strong preference for a &lt;strong&gt;French speaker&lt;/strong&gt; to support our implementations with key global clients.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Adaptability:&lt;/strong&gt; You are comfortable working in a fast-paced, dynamic environment where fast iteration and experimentation are the norm.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Global Vision:&lt;/strong&gt; The opportunity to own and extend our global data, shaped by your implementation experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Kaluza Values&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Here at Kaluza we have five core values that guide us as a business:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Play to win, Solve the real problem, Build trust every day, Own the outcome, Go further together&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;table&gt;
&lt;tbody&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;From us you’ll get&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Pension Scheme&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Discretionary Bonus Scheme&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Private Medical Insurance + Virtual GP&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Life Assurance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Access to Furthr - a Climate Action app&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Free Mortgage Advice and Eye Tests&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Perks at Work - access to thousands of retail discounts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5% Flex Fund to spend on the benefits you want most&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;26 days holiday&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible bank holidays, giving you an additional 8 days which you can choose to take whenever you like&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Progressive leave policies with no qualifying service periods, including 26 weeks full pay if you have a new addition to your family&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Dedicated personal learning and home office budgets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;And more…&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Even better? You’ll have access to these benefits from day 1 when you join.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We want the best people&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re keen to meet people from all walks of life — our view is that the more inclusive we are, the better our work will be. We want to build teams which represent a variety of experiences, perspectives and skills, and we recognise talent on the basis of merit and potential.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We understand some people may not apply for jobs unless they tick every box. But if you&#39;re excited about joining us and think you have some of what we&#39;re looking for, even if you&#39;re not 100% sure, we&#39;d still love to hear from you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Find out more about working at&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;http://kaluza.com/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-saferedirecturl=&quot;https://www.google.com/url?q=http://kaluza.com&amp;amp;source=gmail&amp;amp;ust=1772730023496000&amp;amp;usg=AOvVaw2WQ4QggVd_VKIz_hhKv_E_&quot;&gt;Kaluza&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;on our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://kaluza-dev.webflow.io/careers&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-saferedirecturl=&quot;https://www.google.com/url?q=https://kaluza-dev.webflow.io/careers&amp;amp;source=gmail&amp;amp;ust=1772730023496000&amp;amp;usg=AOvVaw0ieu808CO6v15ojfSZWHzP&quot;&gt;careers page&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/company/kaluza/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-saferedirecturl=&quot;https://www.google.com/url?q=https://www.linkedin.com/company/kaluza/&amp;amp;source=gmail&amp;amp;ust=1772730023496000&amp;amp;usg=AOvVaw1r5cAEyzI_Xc26WGuLbLZx&quot;&gt;LinkedIn&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;You can also find our Applicant Data Protection Policy &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.kaluza.com/applicant-data-protection-notice&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/tbody&gt;
&lt;/table&gt;
